Z||000017||mrfixit58||05-14-2001||01:12 PM||||Aus,<P>To be functional, the upper vents may have to lowered a bit to clear the front crossbar. Otherwise, I think it looks great. My personal favorite would be the fist one (with the black horizontal grills). I'd really like to see it with the vents.<P>Also, since the radiator is leaning forward, do you think the upper vents may actually hurt cooling by re-directing the air flow? It looks like it may act to "push" the air across the face of the radiator instead of through it. Ducts may be needed.<P> <P>------------------<BR>Roy :D<BR>87 GT  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/pennocksize.JPG"> ||||reg||1
