Z||000020||mrfixit58||05-15-2001||09:44 AM||||I took a look at one of my parts cars. It appears that the steel bumper beam may be low enough to clear the upper scoops but the vent would still be pointed at the radiator support. If you pop your front hood and look where the nose bolts, you'll see what I mean. The vents may need additional ducts that first point down then back toward the radiator. <P>Still, the more I look at it the better I like it. The grills, that is. The mesh looks too rice-y for my taste. But, I am a little older than that crowd.  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/wink.gif"><BR><P>------------------<BR>Roy :D<BR>87 GT  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/pennocksize.JPG"> ||||reg||3
